{"about_the_game":"You wake up in a daze in a small village and can't remember anything.<br />\r\nA penguin called Otto tells you that he found you during a snowstorm.<br />\r\nHe was afraid that you wouldn't survive. You learn that many of the penguins are ill.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThey tell you about the mysterious disease called freezing fever. You want to help the penguins make a healing potion to make the sick penguins healthy again. But to do this, you need 4 different herbs that grow on distant lands.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBut where are these lands?<br />\r\nAnd how do you get there?<br />\r\nYou find out that one of these herbs, called frost blossom, only grows here in the cold snowy landscape. But the penguins don't know exactly where it grows.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou set off in search of other settlements to find out if they know the place where the herb you need can be found.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAnd that's where your adventure begins ...","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2410940?t=1749402050","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410940/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749402050","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410940/d02e2ff8504fa3a229a8170331a1d8e8f9be20cc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749402050","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410940/d02e2ff8504fa3a229a8170331a1d8e8f9be20cc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749402050","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"You wake up in a daze in a small village and can't remember anything.<br />\r\nA penguin called Otto tells you that he found you during a snowstorm.<br />\r\nHe was afraid that you wouldn't survive. You learn that many of the penguins are ill.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThey tell you about the mysterious disease called freezing fever. You want to help the penguins make a healing potion to make the sick penguins healthy again. But to do this, you need 4 different herbs that grow on distant lands.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBut where are these lands?<br />\r\nAnd how do you get there?<br />\r\nYou find out that one of these herbs, called frost blossom, only grows here in the cold snowy landscape. But the penguins don't know exactly where it grows.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou set off in search of other settlements to find out if they know the place where the herb you need can be found.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAnd that's where your adventure begins ...","developers":["Pinguin0711"],"dlc":[3076310],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410940/b6cae1089f3a36f235737e99cf9ec40e5da717ad/header.jpg?t=1749402050","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2410940/649361/3eaf3cb5e3f8d51b0b7ca28485015010ada105b5/1750916249/dash_av1.mpd?t=1705092891","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2410940/649361/3eaf3cb5e3f8d51b0b7ca28485015010ada105b5/1750916249/dash_h264.mpd?t=1705092891","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2410940/649361/3eaf3cb5e3f8d51b0b7ca28485015010ada105b5/1750916249/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1705092891","id":256993673,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256993673/movie480.mp4?t=1705092891","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256993673/movie_max.mp4?t=1705092891"},"name":"Gameplay Teil 1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256993673/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1705092891","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/